**2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
**8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
